WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.520
I'm gonna be the first-star idol one day!

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.650
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.960
<i>It's been one week since Koharu moved to Italy.</i>

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.340
<i>I haven't spoken to her since.</i>

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.380
<i>I wonder if Rola's working hard back at home.</i>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.180
<i>Even if I'm alone, I have to do it.</i>

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>I need to do as much Aikatsu as I can.</i>

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.230
<i>Fall Fest must have started.</i>

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:58.240
This isn't good enough. I need to work harder.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.530
Oh, yeah?

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.750
Yuzu-senpai?

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:08.500
Let's enter Fall Fest together!

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:11.750
We're making you an offer you cannot refuse.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.380
I've already submitted our entry.

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.380
Wh-What?

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.510
The members are me, you, and Ako-chan.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:20.890
Our unit name is...

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.640
Yuzukoshou!

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:26.640
Yuzukoshou? But why?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.110
Is it not readily apparent?

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:30.400
Ako-chan.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.860
The "Yu" from Yume, "zu" from Yuzu, and "ko" from Ako.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.240
That makes Yuzukoshou.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.160
Isn't that right, Yuzu-senpai?

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:43.660
It just popped into my head! 
It doesn't really mean anything!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:48.420
That's right, Yuzu-senpai.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.300
Sky-Girl's far and away the favorite to win Fall Fest.{uh}{I'm right! In my world}

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.420
Everyone thinks they've already got it in the bag. {when you mess up the fix I reserve the right to revert}

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:01.550
And that's exactly why I don't want to lose to them no matter what!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.140
How inspiring, Yuzu-senpai.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:06.560
Your unbridled determination is truly admirable.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.860
Saotome Ako promises you her full support.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:12.730
I'll be counting on you.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:14.320
H-Hold on.

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:17.450
Am I going to be performing in Fall Fest too?

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:18.910
Of course!

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:22.700
Just wait a second! This is all too sudden.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:25.080
I haven't even trained for it at all.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:29.830
No problem! We don't go on until near the end.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:30.830
Here!

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:31.830
Yes!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.420
Put your hand in.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.840
O-Okay.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:39.380
All right! Down with S4!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.970
Subaru-kyun love!

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.470
Um...

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.970
Yeah!

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:48.430
Y-Yeah!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.330
Okay! Our dresses are all finished!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:32.370
This is mine! The Wonderful Comic Coord.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:37.080
Don't the speech bubbles and 
haphazard cuts make it unique?{yeah pretty ughy, but I think she's referring to two separate features, the lots-of-different-designs feature and the spliced-together-like-a-collage feature}{yeah we heard it wrong}

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.840
That's astounding, Yuzu-senpai!

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:43.720
And these are your dresses I made to match mine.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.760
Yume-chan's is the Super Girl Coord.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:50.720
Ako-chan gets the Active Girl Coord.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.600
Isn't it cool how they're like American comic heroes?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:58.360
Your fashion sense is superb! 
I'm humbled to be in your presence.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:04:59.730
Yume-chan.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.860
Are you good with this dress?

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.610
Yes, anything's fine...

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.990
I mean, I'd love to use the coord you picked.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:13.910
We're all set then! On to the next step!

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.290
Step forward there.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.960
Now tighten your core and turn!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.130
Looking good!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.130
Let the music flow through you.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:25.130
Don't be distracted by any tiny mistakes.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.640
Dance is all about having fun with the rhythm!

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:30.640
We'll finish it off by holding a pose together.{doesn't this maybe should two lines?}

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:31.890
And stick it!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.350
That went a lot more smoothly than when I was practicing alone!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:41.610
Okay! You both did great.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:44.530
It's all thanks to your masterful instruction, Yuzu-senpai.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.780
Do you mind if we go through it again?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.160
Why?

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.910
Because I need to practice more.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.290
You danced just fine.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:57.830
But... I'm worried.{I kind of wanted to use "scared", but I mostly don't want to use anxious}

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.710
Didn't we learn this song in class?

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.090
I think you've practiced it plenty.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:03.960
Still...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.010
You're going to fail again.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.340
Do you really want to collapse like you did last time?

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.060
Any more than this would be overworking.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:17.230
She's right.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.690
I see.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:20.980
I guess so.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.320
What was that for?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:31.320
You always irritate me to no end, 
but you're particularly irritating today!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:36.200
Just calm down. Let's grab ourselves some snacks from the hall.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.040
Okay, meow!

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:43.960
Such a wide assortment of snacks.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.210
Isn't it? Yume-chan, what are you in the mood for?

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:49.180
I-I'm fine...

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.840
Yume-chan, do you want some candy?{I'm like 65% sure this was how}{I though I... typed this though}

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:57.270
Here.

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:02.560
That was supposed to be Nanakura 
Koharu-chan, right? You nailed it!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:04.980
I'm honored by your praise.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.070
But why?

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:10.110
No particular reason. I just assumed that this is what Koharu would have done.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:12.620
Ako-chan.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:16.740
Come on, girls. Back to our dressing room.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.870
Let's eat!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.630
You aren't going to eat?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.380
Sorry, I don't have much of an appetite.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:34.890
Now why?

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.600
Can't you tell how annoying you're being?!

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:41.140
You usually eat way more than a normal person should!

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.350
Why aren't you eating now?!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.900
I'm just worried...

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.700
If I fail again...

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:02.620
The people who support me

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.040
and even my friends might leave me.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.800
If that happened, then I...

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.260
Is that why you intended to skip the Fest?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.720
You would have sat it out completely had Yuzu-senpai not invited you, right?

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.560
If she saw how weak-willed you've been,

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.060
do you think Koharu would be happy?

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:29.690
Ah, geez! Just eat already!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:33.150
If you don't, I'll eat your share!

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.120
I'm sorry, Ako-chan.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.830
It looks like I made you worry.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.330
Why would I ever be worried?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.590
I have my own personal goal to fulfill.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:48.920
Goal?

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:53.470
Yuzu-senpai! Would you mind sharing the information I requested now?

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.890
Oh, about Subarucchi?

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.550
Please don't say that so loudly!

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.220
Whoops, my bad!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:07.100
Ako-chan agreed to join this unit in exchange for info on Subarucchi.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.360
Huh? Was that why?

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.820
Y-Yes, what of it?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:17.620
Now then, Yuzu-senpai. I believe it's about time to share your special intel on Subaru-kyun!

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.780
What do you want to know?

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:24.250
W-Well, perhaps what he wears to sleep...

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:28.290
Or maybe what kind of girls are his type...

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.170
Hello, have you got a minute?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.010
Here, you can ask him yourself.

00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:36.010
Yo.

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:40.260
What was that crazy sound just now?

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.770
Th-That was...

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.890
J-Just a passing cat.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.770
I think it got scared and ran off.

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.400
Oh yeah, I heard that you formed a unit with Nikaidou. {just being... something here}

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:57.610
It takes some guts to join up with someone from S4.

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:00.530
I'm not that confident...

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.040
You're not acting like yourself.

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:09.540
No matter who you're with or what you're up against, you bust through it with a bright red face.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.500
That's how a boiled octopus should be.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.920
I keep telling you I'm not an octopus!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.420
That's more like it.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:20.220
<i>Not acting like herself? That's exactly what I've been trying to tell Yume!</i>

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:24.430
<i>That's my Subaru-kyun! We're of one heart and mind!</i>

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.730
Later then. Good luck.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:28.020
Bye-bye!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:33.440
<i>Good luck! Subaru-kyun wished me good luck!</i>

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.940
Well? Feeling motivated now?

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.110
Absolutely!

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.450
That's great!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.070
Then this one's for Yume-chan.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:44.790
Is this KirakiLine?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:45.580
Yep!

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:50.080
You have tons of messages from all your fans.{for the record, I'm a there're-er}

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.170
There are so many.

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.590
You haven't logged on in a while, right?

00:10:54.590 --> 00:11:00.130
Don't forget. You have fans waiting to see you on stage again.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.600
Yuzu-senpai...

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:08.810
Besides, it's unbelievably irritating to hear how worried you are when you have me and Yuzu-senpai with you.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.190
Sorry about that.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.860
These donuts are really yummy!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.030
Okay! I'll try some!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:34.590
Miwa Tamagorou's Fall Fest Backstage Attack!

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:37.880
My next interviewees are these three ladies.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:40.220
We're looking forward to it!

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.640
Song Class admin, Ashida Yuri.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.890
Also a Song Class admin, Shirogane Lily.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.470
Dance Class admin, Katsura Miki.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.480
The three admin girls! We are...

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.650
The Admins!

00:11:55.480 --> 00:12:00.490
Goodness, you even have a pose? 
It appears you're more than ready for today.

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:06.490
But of course! We've been preparing for this day for a very long time.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:11.120
We have descended to chase down the four glimmering stars.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:17.250
Standing daylong at the Dress Make counter, 
absorbing the knowledge to weave ever finer dresses.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:22.760
Working backstage at various events to incorporate new ideas and insights into our own performances.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:28.970
Even on days we're beset by illness and can't train, we focus on reading to improve our perspective.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.940
In other words, you have more passion for performing than anyone else.

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.230
Yes!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:36.730
What's up?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:41.240
I just posted on KirakiLine, and look.

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:45.240
Everyone's been waiting for you to say something.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.160
Hi! I'm here for your Fall Fest interview.{I'm pretty sure this is hai as in "hi" but this is fine}{sure, whatevs}

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.120
Do you mind if I intrude?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.330
Please, come on in!

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:02.510
Our next unit is Yuzukoshou.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:06.890
What inspired you three to form a unit together?

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:12.890
It was me! I figured that I'd be able to put on a really fun show with Yume-chan and Ako-chan!

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:19.270
I understood that forming a unit with idols from other classes would be a valuable experience.

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.150
I see, those are very good reasons.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.280
And what about you, Nijino-san?

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:29.780
To be honest, I had originally planned to sit out Fall Fest.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.790
Oh my, and why was that?

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:41.550
I was worried about so many things, and I felt completely lost.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:45.550
What changed your mind?

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:50.680
I'm still feeling unsure, but now I know I'm not alone.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.560
I have partners who will pull me forward,

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.690
and people who will continue to support me.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:06.070
And so, that's why I want to repay them with the best performance I can.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:11.740
Saotome Ako, making her dazzling entrance!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.540
Fun is the best!

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.460
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.010
Yuzukoshou was awesome!

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:58.760
Yeah! Mom, send Yume-chan my thoughts!

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:09.980
Rola.

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:12.190
Is that a friend?

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.190
Yes, she's my rival.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:18.450
Mama, there's someone I don't want to lose to. {in this case, Mama or Mommy?}{the most western the family the more I lean toward Mama, and their house looks suitably western so?}

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:21.660
I'll need to start my music studies over from step one to do it.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:25.250
Please train me!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.460
I am a professional pianist.

00:18:28.460 --> 00:18:32.340
You won't get any leeway just because you're my daughter.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.210
I accept!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:38.840
It's time to announce the results!

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.010
Headmaster, please take it away.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.850
This Fall Fest was an exceptionally close contest.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.480
A thin line separates the ranks.

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:51.100
Keep that in mind for the announcements. In third...

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.980
Sky-Girl.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.780
Next, in second...

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:02.490
Yuzukoshou.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:05.830
We got second place?

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.830
Yay! We beat S4!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:12.380
What? Didn't you want to win?

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:16.550
Finally, the winners of Fall Fest.

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.260
The Admins.

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:26.970
It's us?

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.390
We did it, Katsura-senpai! Lily!

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:32.020
Yay!

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:38.280
Every unit performed at an extremely high level, 
and the standings were too close to call until the end.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:43.780
The deciding factor was the teamwork they developed during their time as admins.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:47.910
Day in and day out, they worked together to complete their admin work,

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:53.920
forming bonds of trust and friendship which 
harmonized into a marvelous performance.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:58.090
The Admins, congratulations.

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.850
We are The Admins!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.690
The Admins were wonderful.

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.610
Thank you.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.530
You bested me this time, but I won't lose again.

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:24.360
We'll keep improving as well.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.490
Um, Yuzu-sama. I have to say...

00:20:27.490 --> 00:20:29.200
You did it, Mikki!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:34.040
I am a bit upset, but I'm really happy that everyone got to appreciate your charms!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.670
Yuzu-sama...

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.880
The Admins, congrats!

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:39.800
Thanks, Yuzu.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.380
Thank you.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:43.880
Yo.

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:45.890
Good job.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:48.640
S-Subaru-kyun?!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.850
<i>H-He came all this way to see me?</i>

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.020
You're looking better than I expected.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.030
Huh? Y-Yeah.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.070
Subaru-kyun!

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.780
If you like Subaru so much, why are you hiding?

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:15.040
Why are you even here?

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:17.380
My work happened to end early.

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:21.880
Anyway, did you take part in the Fest just because you wanted to get closer to Subaru?

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.420
That wasn't my only reason.

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:36.270
According to my analysis, you formed a unit to cheer that girl up.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.270
Am I right?

00:21:38.270 --> 00:21:41.270
Th-That couldn't possibly be!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:47.160
Looks like you didn't manage to win.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.280
Yep, we lost.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:52.040
You seem pretty happy despite that.

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:55.000
Because everyone helped to lift my spirits.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:58.290
Even though I'm the one who's supposed to be doing that.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.540
Sometimes it happens.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:01.920
It does?

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:05.170
Even idols have down periods.

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:08.800
There's nothing wrong with being cheered up by your fans.

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.010
Is that all right?

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:12.180
I'd think so.

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:15.680
All you need to do is give back what you receive.

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:24.190
Yeah, you're right!

00:24:10.760 --> 00:24:12.760
Why can't I beat Yume?

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:14.760
Am I really in a slump?!

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:17.640
Rola-san, would you like to visit a hot spring?

00:24:17.640 --> 00:24:18.930
Just me and you?!

00:24:18.930 --> 00:24:20.850
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.850 --> 00:24:22.230
Lost Rola.

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:24.520
Become the first-star idol!
